  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rɛy buɔk in jio̱l, ji̱n Thi-ɔ-pi-läth, cä ji̱ gɔ̱a̱r ŋɔaani diaal ti ci Yecu kɛ tok kɛ la̱t kɛnɛ tin cɛ ŋi̱eec, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amäni cäŋ ëë naŋkɛ ni jɛ nhial, kɛ kɔr kä mëë cɛ jaakɛ tin cɛ mɛk lat ruac kɛ buɔ̱m Yieekä in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr li̱ethdɛ, cuɛ rɔɔdɛ nyuɔ̱th kɛ kɛ nyuuthni ti ŋuan ti thil diw ɛn ɣöö tëkɛ. Cu jaak ɛ nɛn kɛ ni̱n ti jiɛn ŋuan, kä cɛ ruac kɛ kɛ kɛ kui̱ kuäärä Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë tëë kɛɛl kɛ kɛ, cuɛ kɛ la̱r ɣöö /cikɛ bi jiɛɛn kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ mëë ci Gua̱a̱r in te nhial ɛ lar lip. Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Cia jɛ liŋ kä ɣä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛn ɣöö Jɔ̱ɔ̱n cɛ naath lak kɛ pi̱, kä ba yɛ lak kɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ, kɛ rɛy ni̱n ti tɔt.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naŋ Yecu nhial",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci jaak ben guath kɛl kɛ Yecu, cukɛ jɛ thiec i̱, “Kuäär, nɛmɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th in bi kuäär luɔ̱c ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl thi̱n?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, “/Ciɛ la̱tdun ɛn ɣöö bia ni̱n kiɛ pek tin ci Gua̱a̱r in te nhial kɛ la̱tkɛ buɔ̱mdɛ kärɔa ŋa̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä yɛn bia buɔ̱m jek mi wä Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ ben kä yɛ. Kä bi yɛn a nëënkä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛnɛ rɛy Ju-dia kɛɛliw, kɛ Tha-mɛ-ria kɛnɛ pek ɣɔaa kɛɛliw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min cɛ ti̱ti̱ lat cua Yecu naŋ nhial a guɛckɛ jɛ, kä cu pua̱a̱r ɛ kum waaŋdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wëë, kä ŋot jaak kɛ mi guɛckɛ nhial, cu wutni da̱ŋ rɛw ti tekɛ bieyni ti bo̱o̱r cuɔ̱ŋ gekädiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Yɛn wutni Gɛ̈-lɛ-li, ɛŋu mi cuɔ̱ŋɛ kä guɛcɛ nhial ɔ? Ɛn Yecu ɛmɛ, ca naŋ nhial kä yɛ, bɛ luny jɔk ce̱tkɛ wädɛ nhial in cia nɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuëny ran guäth Ju-däth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ loc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, jiɛɛndiɛn pääm mi cɔal i̱ Ɔ-lip, mi thia̱k kɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ ja̱l mi ciɛk kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cikɛ ben rɛy wec, cukɛ wä duëël in te nhial guäth ëë cieŋkɛ thi̱n, Pi-tɔr kɛ Jɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛ Je-mɛth, kɛ An-dɛ-röw, kɛ Pi-lip kɛnɛ Tɔ-mäth, kɛ Bar-tho-lo-miw kɛnɛ Mɛ̈-thiw, kɛ Je-mɛth gat Ɛ̈l-pi-uth, kɛnɛ Thay-mɔn min cɔal i̱ Dhɛ-lɔt, kɛ Ju-däth gat Je-mɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ diaal amäni män, kɛ Mɛri man Yecu, kɛnɛ gaatman Yecu, cukɛ pal kɛ lɔc kɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ cu Pi-tɔr rɔ jiɛc rɛy dämani tin la ji̱ ŋäthä (kɛn diaal nɛy ti kuɔ̱r kɛl wi̱cdɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw), kä cuɛ wee i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dämaari, bi ruaacni Kuɔth a thuɔ̱k, tëë ca lat ɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ kɛ thok Dee-bid, kɛ kui̱ Ju-däth mëë cu a bo̱o̱th nɛɛni tëë ka̱pkɛ Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ca jɛ mat rɛydan, kä ca jɛ moc gua̱a̱th rɛy läätdä mɛmɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Wut ɛmɛ cɛ kak kɔk kɛ yio̱w läätdä jiäknikɛ, kä mëë cɛ pɛ̈n, cuɛ rɛ̈ɛ̈t kä cu ci̱nkɛ diaal käny raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua nɔmɔ ŋa̱c ɛ nɛy diaal tin cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä inɔ cua kak ɛmɔ cɔl i̱ Ɣa-kɛl-da-ma kɛ thokdiɛn mi lot ni ɣöö, “Kak Riɛm.”) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ ɣöö ca jɛ gɔ̱r rɛy buɔk Diit i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:20a",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 69:25.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
